According to <fmath alttext="{\H}" class="fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">H</mi></fmath>-spectrum; <br> Rydberg formula <fmath alttext="\⇒{1}/{\λ}=\R_{{\H}}({1}/{n_{i}^{2}}-{1}/{n_{2}^{2}})" class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mo class="fm-prefix-tight">⇒</mo><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">λ</mi></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">R</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">H</mi></span></msub><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc" style="font-size: 2.47em; vertical-align: -0.251em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">(</mo><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: -0.252em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><msubsup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">i</mi></span><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msubsup></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: -0.252em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><msubsup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msubsup></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc" style="font-size: 2.47em; vertical-align: -0.251em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath> <br> For first line, <fmath alttext="n_{1}=2 n_{2}=3" class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>1</mn></span></msub><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msub></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></fmath> (Balmer series) <br> <fmath alttext="\λ=656 {
m}" class="fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">λ</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow class="ma-repel-adj"><mn>656</mn><mspace width=".17em" style="margin-right: 0.17em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;">‌</mspace><mi mathvariant="normal" class="ma-repel-adj">nm</mi></mrow></mrow></fmath> <br> <fmath alttext="{1}/{656}=\R_{\H}[{1}/{2^{2}}-{1}/{3^{2}}]" class="fm-inline"><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>656</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">R</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">H</mi></span></msub><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc" style="font-size: 2.26em; vertical-align: -0.195em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">[</mo><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: -0.126em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><msup><mn>2</mn><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: -0.126em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><msup><mn>3</mn><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc" style="font-size: 2.26em; vertical-align: -0.195em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath> <br> <fmath alttext="={5}/{36} \R_{{\H}}" class="fm-inline"><mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>5</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>36</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">R</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">H</mi></span></msub></mrow></mrow></fmath> ...(i) <br> For second line, <fmath alttext="n_{1}=2" class="fm-inline"><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>1</mn></span></msub><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></fmath> and <fmath alttext="n_{2}=4" class="fm-inline"><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msub><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></fmath> <br>  <fmath alttext="{1}/{\λ}=\R_{{\H}}[{1}/{2^{2}}-{1}/{4^{2}}]" class="fm-inline"><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">λ</mi></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">R</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">H</mi></span></msub><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc" style="font-size: 2.26em; vertical-align: -0.195em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">[</mo><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: -0.126em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><msup><mn>2</mn><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: -0.126em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><msup><mn>4</mn><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc" style="font-size: 2.26em; vertical-align: -0.195em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></fmath> <br> <fmath alttext="={3}/{16} \R_{{\H}}" class="fm-inline"><mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>3</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>16</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">R</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">H</mi></span></msub></mrow></mrow></fmath> ...(ii) <br> Dividing Eqs. (i) and (ii) we get, <br> <fmath alttext="{\λ}/{656}={5}/{36} ×{16}/{3}" class="fm-inline"><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">λ</mi></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>656</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>5</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>36</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mo lspace=".22em" rspace=".22em" class="fm-infix">×</mo><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>16</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>3</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></mrow></fmath> <br> <fmath alttext="\λ=485.9 {
m}" class="fm-inline"><mrow><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">λ</mi><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow class="ma-repel-adj"><mn>485.9</mn><mspace width=".17em" style="margin-right: 0.17em; padding-right: 0.001em; visibility: hidden;">‌</mspace><mi mathvariant="normal" class="ma-repel-adj">nm</mi></mrow></mrow></fmath> <br> Similarly, wavelength of limiting line i.e. <fmath alttext="n_{2}=\∞" class="fm-inline"><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msub><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">∞</mi></mrow></fmath> and <fmath alttext="n_{1}=2" class="fm-inline"><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1" mathvariant="italic">n</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mn>1</mn></span></msub><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></fmath> <br> <fmath alttext="{1}/{\λ}=\R_{{\H}}[{1}/{2^{2}}-{1}/{\∞^{2}}]={\R_{{\H}}}/{4}={109737}/{4}" class="fm-inline"><mrow><mrow><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">λ</mi></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">R</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">H</mi></span></msub><mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc" style="font-size: 2.26em; vertical-align: -0.195em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">[</mo><mrow><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: -0.126em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><msup><mn>2</mn><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span><mo class="fm-infix">−</mo><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: -0.126em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>1</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><msup><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">∞</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: 0.7em;"><mn>2</mn></span></msup></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-mo-Luc" style="font-size: 2.26em; vertical-align: -0.195em; display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(0.5);">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0.126em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><msub><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">R</mi><span class="fm-script fm-inline" style="vertical-align: -0.5em;"><mi class="fm-mi-length-1 ma-upright" mathvariant="normal" style="padding-right: 0px;">H</mi></span></msub></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>4</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow><mo class="fm-infix-loose">=</mo><span mtagname="mfrac" style="vertical-align: 0em;"><span class="fm-vert fm-frac"><table><tbody><tr><td class="fm-num-frac fm-inline"><mn>109737</mn></td></tr><tr><td class="fm-den-frac fm-inline"><mn>4</mn></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></mrow></fmath> <br> ∴ <fmath alttext="\λ=364,4 {
